-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Owner       Played by Jon Attree in JNext through the real loader,
              2026-11-03

  Replay      2 bot recordings from the start state, 18000 frames: IDENTICAL,
              12712 plots, 2712078 sprite pixels. Dean's recording from its
              own snapshot, same game banks: IDENTICAL, 7010 plots. Negative
              controls 46/46 detected

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: plain and sprites reach play, nobody
              played; with the loading screen: JNext 1.1.104 headless through
              the real loader, MD5 exact, reached the screen, the game and
              play frames, viewed; no person played it

  Coverage    Later arenas and bosses not reached by the bots. Built from this
              file's RAM run to its USR 59776 as 48K. No trainer prompt:
              Dean's prompt was not in this release; loading screen stub added
              in bank 14, 2026-11-03: the replay and hardware lines are of the
              build without it, whose game memory the stub restores at the
              original start; the stub is emulator-tested only

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
